{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10293040","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10293040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1029304001:1":{"text":"페이, 그리고... 메린의 마법사 친구구나! 메린을 보러 왔니?","source_cn":"菲，还有你……是小梅的魔法师朋友！你们来找小梅吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5D5D6DDB54C5B960","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"페이, 그리고... 메린의 마법사 친구구나! 메린을 보러 왔니?","female":"페이, 그리고... 메린의 마법사 친구구나! 메린을 보러 왔니?","variant_male_record_index":"117462","variant_female_record_index":"117463","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029304002:1":{"text":"아니요, 저희는 할머니를 뵈러 온 거예요!","source_cn":"不是的，梅拉奶奶，我们是来找你的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2667343F626A3A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029304003:1":{"text":"오, 날 도와주러 온 거니? 정말 잘 됐구나. 차를 만들려면 오크라가 많이 필요한데, 마침 오크라를 어떻게 모아야 할지 고민하던 참이었단다.","source_cn":"哦，你们是来帮我的？太好了，我正好在犯愁怎么收集到足够...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AA3B53F3A3472DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1029304004:1":{"text":"오크라를 좀 모아줄 수 있겠니? 잎이 망가지지 않도록 조심해야 한단다. 그럼, 부탁하마.","source_cn":"那你们帮我收集一些花朵吧，记得千万不要损坏花瓣啊。麻烦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x895B6A22C08DE0CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1029304005:1":{"text":"음... 왜 갑자기 오크라 모으는 걸 도와주게 된 거죠?","source_cn":"呃……我们怎么突然变成来帮忙收集花瓣的人了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1BEA3BC4EC063423","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1029304006:1":{"text":"그게, 사실 메이라 할머니는 귀가 좀 안 좋으셔서 잘못 들으신 것 같아요...","source_cn":"那个，其实梅拉奶奶的耳朵稍微有点问题，应该是听错了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9241B6D88BD7B94A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:奶奶梅拉":{"text":"메이라 할머니","source":"奶奶梅拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:菲":{"text":"페이","source":"菲","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}}